<title>JAPAN: M'bishi Nov domestic output down 9.6% y/y.</title>
<headline>M'bishi Nov domestic output down 9.6% y/y.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors Corp said on Wednesday its domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas production in November were, with percentage changes from a year earlier, as follows:</p>
<p> Production	   96,398   down  9.6 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		 62,426   down 15.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     33,972   up    2.8 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales     61,797   up    0.8 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		 31,352   up    7.7 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     30,445   down  5.4 percent</p>
<p> Exports		39,912   up   15.3 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		27,756   up   24.0 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     12,156   down  0.7 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output    68,774   up   24.2 percent</p>
</text>
